 24 (<italic>n</italic> &#x0003d; 10/group) after the initiation of the treatments, respectively.</p></fn><fn id="t1fn2"><label>&#x000b6;</label><p>Measurements that were conducted on day 42 (<italic>n</italic> &#x0003d; 5/group) or day 24 (<italic>n</italic> &#x0003d; 10/group) after the initiation of the treatments, respectively.</p></fn><fn id="t1fn3"><label>&#x02021;</label><p><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05,</p></fn><fn id="t1fn4"><label>&#x000a7;</label><p><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; 0.01,</p></fn><fn id="t1fn5"><label>&#x02020;</label><p><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; 0.001 vs. vehicle-treated DIO mice.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>